                                                "sense_id": "df433568-0b37-3242-bf68-cc8fe5adcaa1",
                                                "text": "The orgone accumulator is an ordinary box big enough for a man to sit inside on a chair: a layer of wood, a layer of metal, and another layer of wood gather in orgones from the atmosphere and hold them captive long enough for the human body to absorb more than a usual share."
